 ],
 "rows": [
  {
   "cue": "a2_c001",
   "line": "a2_c001_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "叔叔，你還好嗎？竹篾掉了。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1.6,
   "voice_start_s": 1.722,
   "diff_s": -0.122,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c001_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c001",
   "line": "a2_c001_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "沒事、沒事，手滑了一下。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 5.5,
   "voice_start_s": 5.635,
   "diff_s": -0.135,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c001_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c001",
   "line": "a2_c001_03",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "大家仔細看，叔叔的手上，／是不是多了什麼？看到的舉手。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 16.13,
   "voice_start_s": 16.253,
   "diff_s": -0.123,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c001_03_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c002",
   "line": "a2_c002_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "咦？／我想揮手……手怎麼跑到旁邊去了？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 13.45,
   "voice_start_s": 13.572,
   "diff_s": -0.122,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c002_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c002",
   "line": "a2_c002_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "叔叔，小心！",
   "subtitle_start_s": 21.48,
   "voice_start_s": 21.603,
   "diff_s": -0.123,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c002_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c003",
   "line": "a2_c003_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "還記得廣場上，／那個閃亮的小盒子嗎？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1.45,
   "voice_start_s": 1.583,
   "diff_s": -0.133,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c003_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c003",
   "line": "a2_c003_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "有一種煙彈，外表像電子煙，／裡面卻可能加了毒品，",
   "subtitle_start_s": 5.88,
   "voice_start_s": 6.016,
   "diff_s": -0.136,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c003_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c003",
   "line": "a2_c003_02",
   "page": 2,
   "text": "有人叫它「喪屍煙彈」。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 11.035,
   "voice_start_s": 13.5,
   "diff_s": -2.465,
   "pass": false,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c003_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c004",
   "line": "a2_c004_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "阿樂叔叔身上這一條一條的線，／叫做操偶線。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 0.8,
   "voice_start_s": 0.935,
   "diff_s": -0.135,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c004_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c004",
   "line": "a2_c004_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "這些線是故事的比喻。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 6.46,
   "voice_start_s": 6.58,
   "diff_s": -0.12,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c004_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c004",
   "line": "a2_c004_02",
   "page": 2,
   "text": "毒品可能讓人的頭腦／和身體受到影響，不聽使喚。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 9.662,
   "voice_start_s": 9.967,
   "diff_s": -0.305,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c004_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c004",
   "line": "a2_c004_02",
   "page": 3,
   "text": "人不會真的變成喪屍。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 16.708,
   "voice_start_s": 16.867,
   "diff_s": -0.159,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c004_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c005",
   "line": "a2_c005_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "第二題！",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1.4,
   "voice_start_s": 1.524,
   "diff_s": -0.124,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c005_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c005",
   "line": "a2_c005_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "阿樂叔叔身上的操偶線，／在比喻什麼？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 3.45,
   "voice_start_s": 3.575,
   "diff_s": -0.125,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c005_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c005",
   "line": "a2_c005_03",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "一，叔叔在練習下／一場紙偶戲的動作。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 7.86,
   "voice_start_s": 7.989,
   "diff_s": -0.129,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c005_03_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c005",
   "line": "a2_c005_04",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "二，人真的會變成喪屍，／被線拉著走。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 13.07,
   "voice_start_s": 13.191,
   "diff_s": -0.121,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c005_04_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c005",
   "line": "a2_c005_05",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "三，毒品可能讓頭腦／和身體不聽使喚。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 17.85,
   "voice_start_s": 17.972,
   "diff_s": -0.122,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c005_05_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c006",
   "line": "a2_c006_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "正解是三：／毒品可能讓頭腦和身體不聽使喚。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1,
   "voice_start_s": 1.134,
   "diff_s": -0.134,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c006_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c007",
   "line": "a2_c007_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "第二盞！不管答對幾個人，／我們都一起完成了這一題。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1.9,
   "voice_start_s": 2.022,
   "diff_s": -0.122,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c007_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c008",
   "line": "a2_c008_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "奇怪……我的手，怎麼不聽話了？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 3.5,
   "voice_start_s": 3.623,
   "diff_s": -0.123,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c008_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c008",
   "line": "a2_c008_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "骨架放到哪裡去了……我想不起來。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 9.46,
   "voice_start_s": 9.583,
   "diff_s": -0.123,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c008_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c008",
   "line": "a2_c008_03",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "叔叔是不是……吸毒了？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 15.45,
   "voice_start_s": 15.571,
   "diff_s": -0.121,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c008_03_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c008",
   "line": "a2_c008_04",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "我們不知道。可是，叔叔需要幫忙。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 19.37,
   "voice_start_s": 19.495,
   "diff_s": -0.125,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c008_04_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c008",
   "line": "a2_c008_05",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "不過，看見一個人站不穩，不能就／說他吸毒，也可能有其他身體狀況。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 24.04,
   "voice_start_s": 24.176,
   "diff_s": -0.136,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c008_05_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c008",
   "line": "a2_c008_05",
   "page": 2,
   "text": "我們要先找大人幫忙。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 33.348,
   "voice_start_s": 33.682,
   "diff_s": -0.334,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c008_05_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c009",
   "line": "a2_c009_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "第三題來了。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1.4,
   "voice_start_s": 1.524,
   "diff_s": -0.124,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c009_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c009",
   "line": "a2_c009_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "看見有人站不穩，／就能確定他吸毒嗎？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 3.5,
   "voice_start_s": 3.625,
   "diff_s": -0.125,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c009_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c009",
   "line": "a2_c009_03",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "一，不能，要先找大人來幫忙。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 7.92,
   "voice_start_s": 8.152,
   "diff_s": -0.232,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c009_03_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c009",
   "line": "a2_c009_04",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "二，可以，看起來像就一定是。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 12.09,
   "voice_start_s": 12.211,
   "diff_s": -0.121,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c009_04_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c009",
   "line": "a2_c009_05",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "三，不能，所以直接走開不用管。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 16.57,
   "voice_start_s": 16.691,
   "diff_s": -0.121,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c009_05_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c010",
   "line": "a2_c010_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "正解是一：不能，／要先找大人來幫忙。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1,
   "voice_start_s": 1.121,
   "diff_s": -0.121,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c010_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c011",
   "line": "a2_c011_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "第三盞燈，亮了。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1.9,
   "voice_start_s": 2.023,
   "diff_s": -0.123,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c011_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c012",
   "line": "a2_c012_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "阿樂，你哪裡不舒服？／我陪你去看醫生，好嗎？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 8.65,
   "voice_start_s": 8.777,
   "diff_s": -0.127,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c012_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c012",
   "line": "a2_c012_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "不用……我休息一下就好。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 14.16,
   "voice_start_s": 14.282,
   "diff_s": -0.122,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c012_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c012",
   "line": "a2_c012_03",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "你家人的電話沒人接，／我晚一點再打。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 19.99,
   "voice_start_s": 20.114,
   "diff_s": -0.124,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c012_03_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c012",
   "line": "a2_c012_04",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "還有，廣場上有人拿閃亮的／盒子給小孩。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 24.25,
   "voice_start_s": 24.374,
   "diff_s": -0.124,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c012_04_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c012",
   "line": "a2_c012_05",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "謝謝你們告訴我，／我會請警察去看看。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 29.07,
   "voice_start_s": 29.194,
   "diff_s": -0.124,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c012_05_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c013",
   "line": "a2_c013_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "阿樂叔叔告訴葉護理師：前幾天，／也有人給他一樣的閃亮小盒子。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1.6,
   "voice_start_s": 1.734,
   "diff_s": -0.134,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c013_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c013",
   "line": "a2_c013_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "那個人說：「試一次沒關係。」／他就試了。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 9.17,
   "voice_start_s": 9.305,
   "diff_s": -0.135,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c013_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c013",
   "line": "a2_c013_03",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "這幾天先不要開車。／我會一直打給你的家人。",
   "subtitle_start_s": 14.6,
   "voice_start_s": 14.732,
   "diff_s": -0.132,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c013_03_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c013",
   "line": "a2_c013_04",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "明天就是紙燈節了……／叔叔會好一點嗎？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 24.58,
   "voice_start_s": 24.717,
   "diff_s": -0.137,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c013_04_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c013",
   "line": "a2_c013_05",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "主燈骨架，到底在哪裡？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 29.4,
   "voice_start_s": 29.524,
   "diff_s": -0.124,
   "pass": true,
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c013_05_v04.wav"
  }
 ],
 "all_pass": false
}